ld be the fourth.** **(H) 🧾 DUTIES.** **ART AUDIT (I drained the slot, so the law applies; both buckets as ordered): AT RISK 748 files / 566.47 MB · LOCAL-ONLY 0 files / 0 KB** (SALVAGED 6, DIVERGED 16, SHIPPED 193). Unchanged since s1156; disposition is **F-1120-2, owner's desk**. Chalk is **not** part of it — committed to main. **ASSAYER `pending/` = 0** (listed, empty). **GAZETTE — no item, filter law working:** reference-tier art, no consumer, nothing player-visible. **TK-01 NOT owed — re-derived, not inherited:** `ticker-digest-2026-07-27.md` is newest and covers yesterday; next owed after 06:00 on **07-29**. **DEPLOY SKIPPED:** zero `src/` merged. **GUARDS:** `goal-tracker` **2/2** around my `goals.json` edit (diff **+4/−2**, no reformat); **full battery deliberately NOT run** — lane-d's 2396-test inventory is live (started 09:24, **>2h40m** at handoff) and `test:power-budget` is load-sensitive (F-1160-2). **BACKUP PUSH attempted per law.** **(I) 🧹 I killed nothing, started no servers, rewrote no history, ran no playwright** — so the owner's `artifacts/` keep-or-revert gets **no fifth vote from me**; three fires still argue REVERT. ⓘ **F-1162-1 did NOT bite this run, by timing not by cure:** `ad7f2a9c` swept only its own output plus the two runner-generated `logs/` files, because I had committed my own work beforehand and nothing foreign sat untracked at root. **The runner is still un-restarted and the fix still inert.** **(J) ➡️ NEXT FIRE, IN ORDER: (1)** re-verify the board per tip — do not inherit this, and use **two-dot, not `--no-merged`**. **(2) DRAIN `suite-red-inventory`** if it has done-moved (>2h40m at handoff); ⚠️ **discount its TIMEOUT bucket** — loadavg ran 9.6–13.6 across this fire, none of which it created. **Then read it before authoring any red repair: it is the measure-first gate for that whole class**, and F-1159-2 is proof the labels are welded (three tests, three mechanisms). **(3) AUTHOR `art-e9-town-icons`** from the banked line in (G) —