tasks/BACKLOG.md:3566:- GATE-WALK #16-18, THE BARON (owner verbatim in masters + 2 screenshots): F-BW-16 the Baron SIEGES when blocked (structure-rampage is canon; barricade-stall was the real winner of attempt 2 — blocked state gains rampage + rising volley cadence; 22/22 untouched) → lane-b · F-BW-17 boss healthbar steadies (head-anchored, upright, never inherits sway; ruling lineage vs Mistake #6 recorded in-code; class-wide) → lane-a · F-BW-18 the Baron's props detail pass ("the stone" to be identified and redesigned per canon; launcher + rockets to the boss-detail bar) → lane-d. GOAL-LEAF DEBT ×3 next fire. ✅ **F-BW-17 SHIPPED FULL s1443 `f790c09f`** (`reviews/lane-boss-healthbar-steady.md`) — position tracks a per-boss head anchor (`BOSS_BAR_HEAD_ANCHORS`, class-wide with a default covering Baron/railcar/Dredge Queen/Homemaker-9000/Salvage Claw/Old Digger), orientation is unconditionally screen-stable, and `BossBarState.yaw` is DELETED so the sway path no longer exists. ⚠️ **DELIBERATE OWNER-ORDERED OVERRIDE OF MISTAKE #6, SCOPED TO BOSS BARS ONLY — both rulings are recorded side by side in the `pools.ts` comment; building damage bars keep the object frame. Do NOT "fix" this backwards.** `pools.ts` was BOTH-MOVED against main's s1440 perf rework → 3-way graft, both sides verified present by marker probe, graft numstat 27/2 + 29/10 **identical to the lane's own**. All 4 adjacent reds proven pre-existing by a clean-main control in the same worktree/server/port with matching inner assertion lines (`e2-enemies:125` maxHp 34.02 vs 37.9323, `:317` wave-hash — inventory `:100-103`), control proven main-equivalent by an EMPTY `git status --porcelain -- src e2e reviews` at `HEAD == main`. Leaf `e1-boss-healthbar-steady` registered merged (**F-1443-1 — SEVENTH consecutive fire of goal-leaf debt; the pattern is structural and wants an attended ruling**). ✅ **F-BW-18 SHIPPED FULL s1443 `d1ea3dfa`** (`reviews/lane-baron-props-detail.md`) — **"the stone" was never a boulder